<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title><%= titulo %></title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;width:1600px;height:900px;overflow:hidden}
body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#081a3a}
.val-slide{position:relative;width:1600px;height:900px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 8% 12%,rgba(28,101,193,.13),transparent 32%),radial-gradient(circle at 92% 16%,rgba(255,118,23,.12),transparent 30%),linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 0%,#f7fbff 70%,#eef6ff 100%);overflow:hidden}
.val-brand{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:410px;height:86px;border-bottom-left-radius:235px 92px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#17498f,#0a3b78 60%,#062d61);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;padding-right:30px;color:#fff;z-index:10}
.val-brand-lock{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.val-brand svg,.val-footer svg{stroke:#fff;fill:none}.val-brand svg{width:42px;height:42px;stroke-width:2.2}.val-brand-word{font-size:39px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px}
.val-header{position:absolute;left:24px;right:24px;top:14px;height:58px;z-index:8}.val-title{font-size:38px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.05;color:#0b2f6c;white-space:nowrap;text-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(11,47,108,.12)}.val-underline{position:absolute;left:1036px;top:15px;width:92px;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:#ff7617;box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,118,23,.34)}
.val-content{position:absolute;left:24px;right:24px;top:80px;bottom:78px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);border:1px solid #d8e4ef;border-radius:19px;box-shadow:0 11px 24px rgba(18,71,125,.12);padding:18px 22px 14px;z-index:3;overflow:hidden}
.val-kpis{height:104px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:12px}.val-kpi{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 0%,#f2f8ff 100%);border:1px solid #cfe0f0;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(14,70,135,.11);padding:15px 16px 11px 19px}.val-kpi:before{content:'';position:absolute;right:-26px;top:-34px;width:112px;height:112px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);opacity:.15}.val-kpi:after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:7px;background:var(--accent)}.val-kpi-name{position:relative;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.35px;font-weight:900;color:#435b75;white-space:nowrap}.val-kpi-value{position:relative;margin-top:8px;font-size:29px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:var(--accent);white-space:nowrap}.val-kpi-sub{position:relative;margin-top:7px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;color:#45556c;white-space:nowrap}.val-kpi.delta-up .val-kpi-value{color:#0aa36f}.val-kpi.delta-down .val-kpi-value{color:#e9502d}
.val-main{height:608px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 392px;gap:18px}.val-chart-panel,.val-side-card{border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#fbfdff 100%);border:1px solid #dbe7f2;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.8),0 7px 18px rgba(17,70,126,.08);overflow:hidden}.val-chart-panel{padding:14px 16px 10px}.val-chart-head{height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.val-chart-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#0b2f6c}.val-legend{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#071833}.val-leg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.val-leg-line{width:42px;height:5px;border-radius:4px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.14)}.val-leg-line:after{content:'';position:absolute;left:16px;top:-5px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
.val-chart-svg{display:block;width:100%;height:500px;overflow:visible}.val-grid{stroke:#dce4ee;stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:2 4}.val-axis{font-size:12px;fill:#071833;font-weight:800}.val-month{font-size:12px;fill:#071833;font-weight:800}.val-line-label{font-size:11.7px;font-weight:900;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:4px;stroke-linejoin:round}.val-data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;color:#071833;box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(18,71,125,.08);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.val-data-table th{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#06336d,#1765c1);color:#fff;height:35px;font-size:15.5px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #8aa3cb;font-weight:900}.val-data-table td{height:43px;border:1px solid #d5e1ec;background:rgba(255,255,255,.98);text-align:center}.val-data-table td:first-child{font-weight:800;text-align:left;padding-left:14px}.val-data-table .currency{width:40px;font-weight:900;text-align:center;padding-left:0}.val-data-table .total td{background:#eaf2ff;font-weight:900;font-size:16px;border-top:3px solid #0b2f6c}.val-dot{display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle;background:var(--dot)}
.val-side-card{padding:14px 14px 13px}.val-side-title{height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#0b2f6c}.val-insights{margin-top:14px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#073b7d 0%,#0d5fbd 58%,#0aa3b8 100%);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(8,60,130,.2);padding:15px 16px 13px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.val-insights:before{content:'';position:absolute;right:-42px;bottom:-62px;width:190px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,118,23,.55)}.val-insights-title{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:10px}.val-insights-title span{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff7617;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:17px}.val-insight{position:relative;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14.7px;line-height:1.18;font-weight:700;margin:7px 0;color:#f7fbff}.val-check{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff7617;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:1px}.val-period{margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border-radius:14px;background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #d4e5f8;padding:13px 14px;color:#0b2f6c;font-size:15px;font-weight:800}.val-period-badge{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:13px;background:#1765c1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:900}.val-footer{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:66px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2e56a0,#063774);display:flex;align-items:center;padding-left:50px;color:#fff;overflow:hidden;z-index:20}.val-footer svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke-width:2}.val-footer-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:17px;font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}.val-footer-inner strong{font-size:25px;color:#ff7414}.val-footer-orange{position:absolute;right:-22px;bottom:-28px;width:180px;height:104px;background:#f8751a;border-radius:70% 0 0 0;transform:rotate(-7deg)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<%
function money(n){ const v=Number(n||0); return v===0 ? '$-' : '$ ' + v.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2}); }
function amount(n){ const v=Number(n||0); return v===0 ? '-' : v.toLocaleString('en-US',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2}); }
function pct(n){ const v=Number(n||0); return Math.abs(v).toFixed(1) + '%'; }
function niceMax(v){ if(v<=0) return 1; const pow=Math.pow(10,Math.floor(Math.log10(v))); const scaled=v/pow; const nice=scaled<=1?1:scaled<=2?2:scaled<=5?5:10; return nice*pow; }
const palette=['#1765c1','#ff7617','#10a6b1','#7c3aed'];
function vividColor(s,si){ const c=String((s||{}).color||'').toLowerCase(); if(!c || c==='#0d4a98' || c==='#06336d') return palette[si%palette.length]; if(c==='#f26b12' || c==='#f8751a') return '#ff7617'; if(c==='#7b8798' || c==='#8e8e8e') return '#10a6b1'; return (s||{}).color || palette[si%palette.length]; }
const chartSeries=(series||[]).map((s,si)=>({ ...s, color:vividColor(s,si), values:(s.values||[]).map(v=>Number(v||0)) }));
const allValues=chartSeries.flatMap(s=>s.values||[]); const maxVal=Math.max(1,...allValues); const yMax=niceMax(maxVal*1.14); const ticks=4;
const W=1160,H=500,ml=98,mr=24,mt=42,mb=58,pw=W-ml-mr,ph=H-mt-mb; const n=(categories||[]).length||1; const lastIdx=Math.max(0,n-1), prevIdx=Math.max(0,n-2);
const sx=i=>ml+(n===1?pw/2:(pw*i/(n-1))); const sy=v=>mt+ph-(Number(v||0)/yMax)*ph;
function labelDy(si,i,val){ const here=chartSeries.map(s=>Number((s.values||[])[i]||0)); const close=here.some((v,idx)=>idx!==si && Math.abs(v-Number(val||0)) < yMax*.06); if(close) return si===0 ? -21 : (si===1 ? 26 : 42); return si===2 ? 26 : -17; }
function safeY(y,dy){ let yy=y+dy; if(yy<15) yy=y+25; if(yy>H-mb-4) yy=y-17; return yy; }
const latestRows=chartSeries.map(s=>({label:s.label,value:Number((s.values||[])[lastIdx]||0),color:s.color})); const totalCurrent=Number(total||latestRows.reduce((sum,r)=>sum+r.value,0)); const prevTotal=chartSeries.reduce((sum,s)=>sum+Number((s.values||[])[prevIdx]||0),0); const delta=totalCurrent-prevTotal; const deltaPct=prevTotal ? (delta/prevTotal)*100 : 0;
const dominant=latestRows.slice().sort((a,b)=>b.value-a.value)[0] || {label:'-',value:0,color:'#1765c1'}; const dominantShare=totalCurrent ? (dominant.value/totalCurrent)*100 : 0; const monthTotals=(categories||[]).map((c,i)=>({category:c,total:chartSeries.reduce((sum,s)=>sum+Number((s.values||[])[i]||0),0)})); const peak=monthTotals.slice().sort((a,b)=>b.total-a.total)[0] || {category:periodo,total:totalCurrent}; const latestLabel=(categories||[])[lastIdx] || periodo;
const trendWord=delta>0?'incremento':delta<0?'reducción':'sin variación'; const trendVerb=delta>0?'aumentó':delta<0?'disminuyó':'se mantuvo'; const deltaClass=delta>=0?'delta-up':'delta-down'; const deltaSign=delta>0?'+':(delta<0?'-':'');
%>
<div class="slide val-slide">
  <div class="brand val-brand"><div class="val-brand-lock"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="18"/><path d="M6 24h36M24 6c5.8 5 8.8 11.1 8.8 18S29.8 37 24 42M24 6c-5.8-5-8.8-11.1-8.8-18S18.2 37 24 42M10 15c8.8 4 19.2 4 28 0M10 33c8.8-4 19.2-4 28 0"/></svg><div class="val-brand-word">COMM</div></div></div>
  <header class="val-header"><div class="val-title"><%= titulo %></div><div class="val-underline"></div></header>
  <main class="val-content">
    <section class="val-kpis">
      <div class="val-kpi" style="--accent:#1765c1"><div class="val-kpi-name">Total valorizado</div><div class="val-kpi-value"><%=money(totalCurrent)%></div><div class="val-kpi-sub"><%=latestLabel%></div></div>
      <div class="val-kpi" style="--accent:<%=dominant.color%>"><div class="val-kpi-name">Mayor componente</div><div class="val-kpi-value"><%=money(dominant.value)%></div><div class="val-kpi-sub"><%=dominant.label%> · <%=pct(dominantShare)%></div></div>
      <div class="val-kpi" style="--accent:#ff7617"><div class="val-kpi-name">Máximo del período</div><div class="val-kpi-value"><%=money(peak.total)%></div><div class="val-kpi-sub"><%=peak.category%></div></div>
      <div class="val-kpi <%=deltaClass%>" style="--accent:<%=delta>=0?'#0aa36f':'#e9502d'%>"><div class="val-kpi-name">Variación vs mes anterior</div><div class="val-kpi-value"><%=delta===0?'0.0%':deltaSign + pct(deltaPct)%></div><div class="val-kpi-sub"><%=money(Math.abs(delta))%> de <%=trendWord%></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="val-main">
      <div class="val-chart-panel">
        <div class="val-chart-head"><div class="val-chart-title">Evolución mensual de valorización (USD)</div><div class="val-legend"><% chartSeries.forEach(s=>{ %><span class="val-leg"><i class="val-leg-line" style="background:<%=s.color%>;color:<%=s.color%>"></i><%=s.label%></span><% }) %></div></div>
        <svg class="val-chart-svg" viewBox="0 0 1160 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <% for(let k=0;k<=ticks;k++){ const val=yMax*k/ticks; const y=sy(val); %>
            <line class="val-grid" x1="<%=ml%>" y1="<%=y%>" x2="<%=W-mr%>" y2="<%=y%>"/>
            <text class="val-axis" x="<%=ml-36%>" y="<%=y+4%>" text-anchor="end"><%= k===0?'$-':money(val) %></text>
          <% } %>
          <line x1="<%=ml%>" y1="<%=sy(0)%>" x2="<%=W-mr%>" y2="<%=sy(0)%>" stroke="#697b91" stroke-width="1.1"/>
          <% (categories||[]).forEach((c,i)=>{ %><text class="val-month" x="<%=sx(i)%>" y="<%=H-25%>" text-anchor="middle"><%=c%></text><% }) %>
          <% chartSeries.forEach((s,si)=>{ const pts=(s.values||[]).map((v,i)=>`${sx(i)},${sy(v)}`).join(' '); %>
            <polyline points="<%=pts%>" fill="none" stroke="<%=s.color%>" stroke-width="4.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <% (s.values||[]).forEach((v,i)=>{ const x=sx(i), y=sy(v), ly=safeY(y,labelDy(si,i,v)); %>
              <circle cx="<%=x%>" cy="<%=y%>" r="6.8" fill="<%=s.color%>" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/>
              <text class="val-line-label" x="<%=x%>" y="<%=ly%>" fill="<%=s.color%>" text-anchor="middle"><%=money(v)%></text>
            <% }) %>
          <% }) %>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <aside class="val-side-card">
        <div class="val-side-title">Detalle <%=periodo%></div>
        <table class="val-data-table">
          <thead><tr><th><%=tablaTitulo%></th><th colspan="2"><%=periodo%></th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <% latestRows.forEach(r=>{ %><tr><td><span class="val-dot" style="--dot:<%=r.color%>"></span><%=r.label%></td><td class="currency">$</td><td><%=amount(r.value)%></td></tr><% }) %>
            <tr class="total"><td>Total</td><td class="currency">$</td><td><%=amount(totalCurrent)%></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="val-insights"><div class="val-insights-title"><span>✓</span>Observaciones clave</div><div class="val-insight"><span class="val-check">1</span><div>El total de <%=periodo%> fue <b><%=money(totalCurrent)%></b>, con mayor peso en <b><%=dominant.label%></b>.</div></div><div class="val-insight"><span class="val-check">2</span><div>El mes de mayor valorización fue <b><%=peak.category%></b> con <b><%=money(peak.total)%></b>.</div></div><div class="val-insight"><span class="val-check">3</span><div>Respecto al mes anterior, el costo <%=trendVerb%> en <b><%=deltaSign%><%=pct(deltaPct)%></b>.</div></div></div>
        <div class="val-period"><div class="val-period-badge">▦</div><div>Período analizado:<br><b><%=(categories||[])[0] || ''%> – <%=latestLabel%></b></div></div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer val-footer"><div class="val-footer-inner"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="18"/><path d="M6 24h36M24 6c5.8 5 8.8 11.1 8.8 18S29.8 37 24 42M24 6c-5.8 5-8.8 11.1-8.8 18S18.2 37 24 42M10 15c8.8 4 19.2 4 28 0M10 33c8.8-4 19.2-4 28 0"/></svg><span>www.<strong>COMMUNICATIONS</strong>.com.pe</span></div><span class="val-footer-orange"></span></footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>